WEBVTT

00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:09.620
<i>Rei Shenshoujin rei zizzl.</i>

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:17.490
<b>Episode 10 
Countdown to Loss</b>

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:19.740
You're using the Shenshoujin

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:22.330
as her Gear, aren't you?

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:24.240
Mom, you need to stay lying down!

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:28.090
We require it to break the seal,

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:30.810
but it has the power to deceive the heart.

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:35.250
You put her up to this, didn't you, doctor?

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:38.940
I simply used it at the appropriate time.

00:02:40.210 --> 00:02:42.800
Don't look so scared.

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:45.000
Why don't we talk for a bit?

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:48.140
I'm sure I can help you.

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:50.890
Help me?

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:52.010
Yes...

00:02:52.010 --> 00:02:55.770
With the power to get what you want.

00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:00.760
It seems that girl you brought

00:03:00.760 --> 00:03:04.670
is the friend and classmate of 
fusion-syndrome patient #1.

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:07.250
All the girls who attend Lydian

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:11.040
are potential Symphogear-wielders.

00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:13.480
In other words, you used your LiNKER and forced her

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:15.970
to become a wielder, without understanding anything?

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:19.420
That isn't quite right...

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:22.510
If merely injecting LiNKER into someone

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:25.880
made them a Symphogear-wielder, it would 
be the easiest thing in the world.

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:28.300
We could make dozens or hundreds.

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:31.440
Then how did you...

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:33.600
It was love!

00:03:33.950 --> 00:03:35.690
Where did love come from?

00:03:36.310 --> 00:03:41.010
The LiNKER connected her desire to prevent 
her friend from fighting anymore

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:44.240
to the Shenshoujin...

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:47.490
So beautiful, isn't it?

00:03:53.890 --> 00:03:55.000
Kohinata?

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:58.410
Why is she dressed like that?

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:03.010
That wielder is expendable, created using LiNKER.

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:05.950
Since her creation was faster than ours,

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:07.230
she'll break even more easily...

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:09.390
What the hell?

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:11.500
We've confirmed the safety

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:14.400
of the missing Kohinata Miku, but...

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:16.090
"Safety"?

00:04:16.090 --> 00:04:18.080
You call that safe?

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:22.310
Then what are we supposed to tell the dummy?!

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:24.410
Hibiki-chan...

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:28.030
FIS... What are you doing?

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:46.140
This is my job!

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:55.310
<i>A Gatling gun has no need for greetings.</i>

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:57.730
<i>Disparity's heading for the trash bin.</i>

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:01.230
<i>One, two, three! Get out of my sight...</i>

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:04.860
<i>If you want me to blow a hole in you,</i>

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:04.430
Bye—

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:07.320
<i>get in line and say, "Adios."</i>

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:07.210
I guess not.

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:11.270
<i>One, two, three! Get out of my face...</i>

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:09.860
<i>I'm sorry, Yukine.</i>

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:14.550
<i>Feelings burned into hot metal,</i>

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:16.870
<i>for the warm ties that bind me.</i>

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:19.250
<i>This stuff ain't my style,</i>

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:21.670
<i>but I don't mind...</i>

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:25.840
<i>Be a good kid, and go the hell to bed.</i>

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:30.740
<i>Ha ha! Go to hell! It's super confession time!</i>

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:33.060
Direct feedback to the brain

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:35.390
<i>Go kneel and beg before Satan, in the pits of Hell.</i>

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:35.800
executes a battle program,

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:40.860
<i>Ha ha! Go to hell! I won't regret anymore!</i>

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:37.850
regardless of her will.

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:40.860
This is the Shenshoujin Symphogear!

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:43.860
And my LiNKER, which enables 
her to use it, is even better.

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:45.540
<i>I have a place to protect now,</i>

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:46.340
Even so, a false will

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:49.750
<i>so I won't run anymore!</i>

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:48.680
won't make her a match for those wielders.

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:54.120
<i>What do you want on your tombstone?</i>

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:56.530
<i>Get ready for the inferno.</i>

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:56.530
Ichaival is overwhelming her.

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:57.750
Maybe we can...

00:05:56.530 --> 00:06:00.380
<i>One, two, three! Say your prayers...</i>

00:06:01.260 --> 00:06:03.590
<i>Your god's on vacation.</i>

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:06.100
<i>Namu Amida Butsu is all sold out.</i>

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:06.100
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:09.950
<i>One, two, three! Get down on your knees...</i>

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:07.890
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:13.220
<i>I like to be on even terms,</i>

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:12.730
Master...

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:15.640
<i>and I've had a bit too much luck.</i>

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:18.060
<i>I want to repay my debts,</i>

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:20.270
<i>so let me go...</i>

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:21.440
<i>Hurting her is tough...</i>

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:24.630
<i>Be a good kid, and go the hell to bed.</i>

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:25.110
<i>Even if I'm doing this to save her, 
I still owe her a lot!</i>

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:29.360
<i>Ha ha! Go to hell! It's super bullet time!</i>

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:32.380
<i>A rain of powder and gun smoke.</i>

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:34.330
<i>The circus is having a dance.</i>

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:39.580
<i>Ha ha! Go to hell! This love I've been taught...</i>

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:44.360
<i>I load it into my gun, take a deep breath,</i>

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:47.630
<i>and unleash it!</i>

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:52.570
Miku!

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:07.150
You should treat girls more gently.

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:09.730
If you try to violently remove her Gear,

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:13.170
the connected terminal may damage her brain.

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:18.160
Dodge, Yukine!

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:20.000
<b>Flash of Light</b>

00:07:23.450 --> 00:07:25.420
You're still trying this crap?!

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:41.430
<i>A flash of light, a world begins.</i>

00:07:41.430 --> 00:07:44.480
<i>Pitch black, a world ends.</i>

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:45.940
Death!

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:47.430
<i>Annihilation... The place you call home,</i>

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:50.430
<i>the place where the sun shines.</i>

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:53.450
<i>Shooting stars... That day is far away.</i>

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:54.940
Then...

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:56.320
<i>Recollection... Everything is far away.</i>

00:07:56.320 --> 00:07:59.450
<i>Give it back, give it back.</i>

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:59.450
<b>Shooting Star</b>

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:01.040
I'll use my reflectors!

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:04.880
<i>The echoes warm my song...</i>

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:10.880
<i>Your left hand slips through my fingers.</i>

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:20.550
<i>I want to protect you, too!</i>

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:22.160
Shirabe! Run, now!

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:25.950
<i>The memoria of those wonderful days,</i>

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:25.120
Before they erase you!

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:26.260
What are you talking about?

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:29.150
<i>the melody that connects the two of us.</i>

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:28.580
<i>The Ichaival's reflectors</i>

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:31.300
<i>deflected the shot that blew up the Moon.</i>

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:34.980
<i>The past, today, and yes, the future!</i>

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:35.660
<i>I don't know what relic that 
Symphogear was made from,</i>

00:08:34.980 --> 00:08:37.930
<i>I'll never give you up.</i>

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:38.490
<i>but nothing it has could possibly...</i>

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:41.030
<i>I won't let you leave me.</i>

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:41.030
<i>So why am I being pushed back?</i>

00:08:41.030 --> 00:08:50.250
<i>I love you so much... Yes, I love you!</i>

00:08:41.590 --> 00:08:43.420
Innocent and fierce,

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:46.750
a flood of power that wards off evil.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:49.710
This is the Shenshoujin Symphogear.

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:53.420
<i>My reflectors are being disintegrated!</i>

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:01.930
<i>Those memoria of oblivion,</i>

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:04.770
<i>those days when we laughed and cried.</i>

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:10.980
<i>The hand I gripped tight is warm, so warm.</i>

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:08.940
Pay attention!

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:17.090
<i>I'll never forgive... I can't forgive myself.</i>

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:17.760
<i>If I try to dodge to the side, I'll have to slow down.</i>

00:09:17.090 --> 00:09:26.120
<i>That's why I fight... Yes, I fight!</i>

00:09:17.760 --> 00:09:19.460
<i>And in that instant, it will catch up!</i>

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:20.750
It's catching up!

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:21.290
Tsubasa!

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:28.790
We're blocked in?

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:31.720
Stop talking, or you'll bite your tongue!

00:09:51.160 --> 00:09:52.550
Stop it!

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:54.130
Shirabe is one of us!

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:55.900
She's one of us!

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:58.280
Can you really say that?

00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:02.410
She betrayed us and helped the enemy.

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:06.910
Can you really call Tsukuyomi one of us?

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:09.410
<i>No.</i>

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:13.220
<i>I wasn't able to open up to her...</i>

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:17.060
<i>I betrayed Shirabe!</i>

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:18.930
Kiri-chan!

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:24.180
The doctor's method of doing 
things won't save the weak.

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:27.150
Maybe not...

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:30.630
In the face of the coming disaster,

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:32.440
we are simply far too powerless.

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:37.420
Data on the Symphogears and relics

00:10:37.420 --> 00:10:40.350
is in more hands than just ours. {D: TC - is this okay? I rephrased because the original phrasing sounded like he was saying that these things should belong to everyone, and I didn't really think he meant that. I thought that he was saying other people already have these things/data. If I'm wrong, revert or rephrase}

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:43.280
If we have any advantage,

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:45.910
it is the Staff of Solomon!

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:13.140
He unleashed the Noise?

00:11:13.140 --> 00:11:14.730
Damn it all!

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:17.120
<i>As long as the Staff of Solomon is around,</i>

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:19.710
<i>the Treasury of Babylonia is still open?</i>

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:35.710
This is the only way I can leave anything behind!

00:11:36.430 --> 00:11:38.420
That's right... That's it.

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.270
Just keep her where she is.

00:11:40.570 --> 00:11:43.200
And then watch as our friend 
there finishes things up.

00:11:52.670 --> 00:11:55.110
Must I simply stand here and watch?

00:12:03.060 --> 00:12:05.310
Miku-chan is leaving the combat zone.

00:12:05.310 --> 00:12:06.400
I'm tracking her.

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:08.380
Miku...

00:12:08.880 --> 00:12:11.370
Let Chris-kun handle the Noise!

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:14.040
We'll try to rescue as many as we can!

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:19.230
<i>I could shake her off.</i>

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:21.790
<i>But if I do that...</i>

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:28.260
Shirabe!

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:29.310
Ogawa-san?

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:31.950
Leave the rescue effort to us.

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:34.730
You follow Miku-san!

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:37.350
Ogawa-san, take care of her!

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:50.120
Shirabe...

00:12:52.610 --> 00:12:53.590
Kiri-chan...

00:12:56.700 --> 00:12:59.020
<i>Before I disappear,</i>

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:01.460
<i>there's something I have to do!</i>

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:09.550
Must die!

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:18.770
I'll do it.

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:24.900
<b>Guillotine Jabberwock</b>

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:28.620
<b>Thousand Falling Tears</b>

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:31.200
What are you trying to do?

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:33.140
Even if I disappear,

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:35.580
I don't want Shirabe to forget!

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:39.810
The energy from Miku-chan's Gear has the ability

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:42.840
to degrade any power derived from relics.

00:13:43.100 --> 00:13:46.470
Does that mean that we can't 
block her with a Symphogear?

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:50.450
How can we stop this relic-killer?

00:13:54.050 --> 00:13:55.030
Master!

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:56.140
What is it?

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:02.620
There is blood in that girl's songs...

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:07.400
The light of the Shenshoujin,

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:09.800
its output amplified by human phonic gain...

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:13.130
If we fire that at Frontier...

00:14:14.710 --> 00:14:18.710
This time, we can break the seal on Frontier.

00:14:21.220 --> 00:14:21.960
Mom!

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:26.470
Doctor, help Mom!

00:14:26.980 --> 00:14:29.630
She's outlived her usefulness,

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:31.040
but I suppose I can.

00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:38.630
I have to do it.

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:40.030
I have to...

00:14:54.210 --> 00:14:55.290
I know...

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:58.890
That's the cross I have to bear!

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:17.310
Let's go back together, Miku.

00:15:19.470 --> 00:15:20.770
I can't.

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:25.320
I have something I have to do.

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:27.820
Something you have to do?

00:15:28.390 --> 00:15:30.850
He said the light from this Gear

00:15:31.210 --> 00:15:33.840
will shine upon a new world.

00:15:34.890 --> 00:15:36.950
It's a world without war,

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:40.330
in which everyone can live in peace.

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:42.560
A world without war?

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:46.120
I don't want you to fight.

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:50.380
So I'm going to make a world 
in which you don't have to.

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:58.890
But will a world you make in this 
way really be warm, Miku?

00:16:01.030 --> 00:16:03.520
The world I love most

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:07.170
is in the gentle sunlight, when you're with me.

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:11.470
But it will be a world where you don't have to fight.

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:14.590
Even if I have to fight you,

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:16.950
I won't let that happen!

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:20.330
I don't want to let you fight!

00:16:21.130 --> 00:16:22.170
Thank you.

00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:24.140
But I am

00:16:24.740 --> 00:16:25.860
going to fight.

00:16:27.780 --> 00:16:35.570
<i>Balwisyall nescell Gungnir tron.</i>

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:06.250
<i>Overcome a billion histories.</i>

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:11.960
<i>Answer the question (go) in my 
heart (go), and shine...</i>

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:10.870
Hibiki-chan has moved into negotiation phase B!

00:17:10.870 --> 00:17:12.620
Initiating countdown.

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:16.670
<i>Feelings hotter than burning flames.</i>

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:22.180
<i>With steel (go) lightning (go), 
blow them away, my Gungnir!</i>

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:24.850
<i>The shortest and fastest route...</i>

00:17:25.320 --> 00:17:26.490
<i>It's so hot.</i>

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:29.220
<i>It's like all my blood is about to boil over.</i>

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:33.320
You want to use those energy waves

00:17:33.590 --> 00:17:36.320
to disable Miku-kun's Gear?

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:39.000
I'll do it! I'll make it happen!

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:40.750
But your body...

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:43.160
Tsubasa-san and Chris-chan are fighting,

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:44.830
so I'm the only one who can do it!

00:17:45.200 --> 00:17:47.080
I'll bring Miku back, even if it kills me.

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:48.580
I won't allow you to die!

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:51.000
Then I'll return alive, even if it kills me!

00:17:51.350 --> 00:17:53.630
I'll do it, no matter what!

00:17:55.410 --> 00:17:58.700
Calculating from past data 
and present fusion state,

00:17:58.700 --> 00:18:01.850
Hibiki-san's time limit is two 
minutes and forty seconds.

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:04.610
Even if it isn't much...

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:08.910
If we can support Hibiki-chan, I'm sure...

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:13.980
You have very little time before you'll overheat.

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:15.860
Do you have a plan to win?

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:18.700
You can't use numbers to describe 
something you just came up with!

00:18:24.570 --> 00:18:29.460
<i>I'll stand up as many times as it takes.</i>

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:34.920
<i>Take a little (go) look at (go) 
the path I've walked this far.</i>

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:34.190
The time bomb in your chest is the real thing.

00:18:34.190 --> 00:18:36.540
Don't forget that exceeding

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:42.430
<i>The story (go) I've built up (go) 
so far is shining brightly.</i>

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:38.590
the mission time limit means death!

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:39.830
<i>Death...</i>

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:41.860
<i>I'm going to die?</i>

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:45.270
I can't die!

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:50.480
<i>Someday, in the future, people will be linked.</i>

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:55.730
<i>The words (fly) I receive (fly) from my dear friend...</i>

00:18:55.730 --> 00:19:00.860
<i>I promise (promise) I'll use them 
(use them) to create a dream!</i>

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:04.820
<i>Resound (resound)! Share (share)! Sing (sing)!</i>

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:11.130
<i>My elegy of love, roaring with its full might...</i>

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:15.370
<i>Resound (resound)! Share (share)! Sing (sing)!</i>

00:19:15.370 --> 00:19:24.600
<i>And thus, uniting courage and everything else!</i>

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:25.100
She's entering the danger zone.

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:30.230
Fighting is wrong.

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:34.910
Not fighting is the only thing that 
truly promises a warm world.

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:37.300
I need to release her from fighting.

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:44.560
<i>No!</i>

00:19:44.560 --> 00:19:46.970
<i>This isn't what I want to do!</i>

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:50.370
<i>It isn't, but...</i>

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:52.920
<i>You, and I, and everyone (everyone)...</i>

00:19:52.920 --> 00:20:00.340
<i>What flowers will bloom on the path we've walked?</i>

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:56.550
<i>Who's messing with Miku's body?</i>

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:04.800
<i>Resound (resound)! Share (share)! Sing (sing)!</i>

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:03.900
Let me go!

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:07.130
No! I won't let you go!

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:09.110
I'll never let you go!

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:11.260
Hibiki!

00:20:10.530 --> 00:20:11.860
I won't let you go!

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:17.480
<i>Never! Never!</i>

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:19.120
It's coming!

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:21.150
The path to Frontier!

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:24.660
If that thing can erase relics...

00:20:26.880 --> 00:20:28.660
Then take it off,

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:31.540
Miku!

00:20:58.560 --> 00:21:01.440
The mission was a success?

00:21:03.430 --> 00:21:05.530
The mission was a success.

00:21:06.020 --> 00:21:08.110
The seal is broken.

00:21:08.110 --> 00:21:11.040
Now, it's time for Frontier to surface.

00:22:59.880 --> 00:23:01.120
What's happening?

00:23:20.710 --> 00:23:21.520
Wha—

00:23:31.590 --> 00:23:32.940
Yukine...

00:23:33.940 --> 00:23:35.320
Goodbye.
